name: sim.systemSemaphore
description: Acquires or releases a system-wide semaphore, i.e. across several CoppeliaSim instances
luaSynopsis: sim.systemSemaphore(string key, bool acquire)
pythonSynopsis: sim.systemSemaphore(string key, bool acquire)
inputs:
1. key: the key
2. acquire: whether the semaphore should be acquired or released
outputs:
